1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:01,501
Twenty-nine days in a row.

2
00:00:01,801 --> 00:00:04,083
One missed day. Back to zero.

3
00:00:04,383 --> 00:00:06,779
What if a habit grew, instead?

4
00:00:07,079 --> 00:00:07,916
Meet Streak.

5
00:00:08,216 --> 00:00:12,311
Every time you show up,
your habit grows a leaf.

6
00:00:12,611 --> 00:00:15,340
Keep showing up, and the garden fills in.

7
00:00:15,640 --> 00:00:18,575
Miss a day? It wilts. It doesn't reset.

8
00:00:18,875 --> 00:00:22,910
Because the days you showed up
are still there. In the roots.

9
00:00:23,210 --> 00:00:26,460
Streak. For iPhone and Android.

10
00:00:26,760 --> 00:00:29,183
Grow habits. Not checkmarks.

